<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.2.8">
<l>ētaṅ kaḷāyiṉa vellā miṟaṅkali ṭuvitteṉ ṉuḷḷē</l>
<l>pītaka vāṭaip pirāṉār pirama kuruvāki vantu</l>
<l>pōtil kamalavaṉ ṉeñcam pukuntu meṉceṉṉit tiṭaril</l>
<l>pāta vilacciṉai vaittār paṇṭaṉṟu paṭṭiṉaṅ kāppē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Even though the Lord of golden garments,</l>
<l rend="indent">came as Supreme guru</l>
<l>into my heart, caused all [my] faults to vanish,</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] entered [my] stout lotus heart without leaving,</l>
<l>he put the mark of [His] feet upon the top of my head.</l>
<l rend="indent">Unlike before, [this] maritime town has protection.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
